{number: 82}
{title: Standing on the Promises}
{key: Bb}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Bb] Standing on the promises of Christ my King,
Thro' eternal ages let His praises [F7] ring;
[Bb] Glory in the highest, I will shout and sing,
Standing on the [F7] promises of [Bb] God.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Bb] Standing, [Eb] standing,
[F7] Standing on the promises of [Bb] God my Savior;
[Bb] Standing, [Eb] standing,
I'm [Bb] standing on the [F7] promises of [Bb] God.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[Bb] Standing on the promises that cannot fail,
When the howling storms of doubt and fear as-[F7] sail,
By the [Bb] living Word of God I shall prevail,
Standing on the [F7] promises of [Bb] God.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[Bb] Standing on the promises of Christ the Lord,
Bound to Him eternally by love's strong [F7] cord,
Over-[Bb] coming daily with the Spirit's sword,
Standing on the [F7] promises of [Bb] God.
{end_of_verse}
